Lucky Lode — node fork attribution
===================================

This directory is a fork of VerusCoin/VerusCoin (branch `emberhash-swap`,
upstream `master` pinned at 5ec1d83 / v1.2.18), which is itself derived from
the Komodo and Zcash codebases. Lucky Lode modifies the proof-of-work
(EmberHash), the difficulty retarget, and the block-reward / Lucky Pot rules.

